<h1>Inspection Pane</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-US">The</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Inspection</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">pane is additional one and it appears only in</span> <span class="Mode">Inspection</span> <span lang="EN-US">mode. It is also located in the left hand side of the KUBEs window. The two panes (Scan and Inspect) are overlapped and user can switch between them by clicking on their tabs (which are in the lower left hand side)</span><span lang="EN-US">.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US">The Pane is divided in 5 main sections:</span></p>
